# Python bytecode. Two .pyc files were committed in #21 (cpython-312 bytecode,
# while the image runs Python 3.13) after a local `py_compile` was swept up by
# `git add -A`. They never reached the image — the Dockerfile copies named
# source files — but they do not belong in the tree.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
